@aspect_execution_guidance:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by their direct usefulness as execution-time guidance.
@aspect_execution_guidance:inclusion text
Include KUs that tell the runtime when a component should be selected, what input shape it expects, or what output discipline it requires.
@aspect_execution_guidance:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that provide only abstract background without actionable execution guidance.
@aspect_execution_guidance:protocol text
Prefer caller profiles, prompt assets, and command/interpreter guidance KUs whose metadata or body directly constrains the next execution step.
@aspect_execution_guidance:role_vocabulary json
["primary guidance", "prompt asset", "routing cue"]
@aspect_execution_guidance:query_terms json
["guidance", "execution", "use", "routing", "prompt", "input", "output"]
